flowchart TD

    A[Shutdown] --> B[Begin Engine Shutdown]

    B --> B1[Set Engine Running = false]
    B1 --> B2[Stop Accepting New Engine Commands]
    B2 --> B3[Stop Simulation]

    %% =========================================================
    %% WINDOWS
    %% =========================================================

    B3 --> C[Request All Windows Close]

    C --> C1[WindowHandler.StopAcceptingWindows]
    C1 --> C2[Signal Silk.NET Windows To Close]
    C2 --> C3[Window Loops Exit]
    C3 --> C4[Dispose Per-Window Renderer Resources]
    C4 --> C5[Dispose Silk.NET Windows]

    %% =========================================================
    %% ECS / SCENE
    %% =========================================================

    C5 --> D[Unload Active Scene Async]

    D --> D1[Run OnDisable]
    D1 --> D2[Run OnDestroy]
    D2 --> D3[Destroy Entities]
    D3 --> D4[Apply Final ECS Structural Changes]

    %% =========================================================
    %% SYSTEM SHUTDOWN
    %% =========================================================

    D4 --> E[Shutdown Runtime Systems Async]

    E --> E1[PhysicsSystem.ShutdownAsync]
    E --> E2[AnimationSystem.ShutdownAsync]
    E --> E3[AudioSystem.ShutdownAsync]
    E --> E4[AssetSystem.ShutdownAsync]

    E1 --> EB[await Task.WhenAll]
    E2 --> EB
    E3 --> EB
    E4 --> EB

    %% =========================================================
    %% CORE SHUTDOWN
    %% =========================================================

    EB --> F[Shutdown Core Systems]

    F --> F1[ECS.ShutdownAsync]
    F1 --> F2[Drain Job System]
    F2 --> F3[JobSystem.ShutdownAsync]
    F3 --> F4[WindowHandler.ShutdownAsync]
    F4 --> F5[FileSystem.ShutdownAsync]

    %% =========================================================
    %% FINAL CLEANUP
    %% =========================================================

    F5 --> G[Dispose Dependency Injection Container]
    G --> G1[Flush Logs Async]
    G1 --> G2[Shutdown Logging]
    G2 --> H[Process Exit]